@HotelAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5202
@ProductId = 1
@UserId = 1
@ReservationId = 1

### List with X-Total-Count (apply the SQL script first)
GET {{HotelAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Set an actual available quantity manually before reserving (do not invent stock)
# PATCH {{HotelAPI_HostAddress}}/api/products/{{ProductId}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "availableQuantity": 10 }

### Reserve: 201; missing Product/User: 404; invalid quantity/insufficient stock: 400
POST {{HotelAPI_HostAddress}}/api/productreservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": {{ProductId}}, "userId": {{UserId}}, "quantity": 1 }

### Read reservation
GET {{HotelAPI_HostAddress}}/api/productreservations/{{ReservationId}}

### Cancel: 204; no active reservation (missing or already cancelled): 404
POST {{HotelAPI_HostAddress}}/api/productreservations/{{ReservationId}}/cancel

### Carts and order items require an explicit unused ID (non-Identity keys).
# POST /api/carts: { "idCart": 100, "userId": 1 }
# POST /api/orderitems: { "idOrderItem": 100, "orderId": 1, "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
